### POST a JSON body (httpbin echoes it back)
POST https://httpbin.org/post
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "project": "tide-commander",
  "feature": "http-requests-building",
  "nested": {
    "bool": true,
    "number": 42,
    "list": [1, 2, 3]
  }
}

### POST form-urlencoded
POST https://httpbin.org/post
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=riven&action=sample&remember=true

#### Create a post (deep-name separator: extra #'s still name the request)
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sample from Tide Commander",
  "body": "Created by the HTTP requests building",
  "userId": 7
}

### PUT — full update
PUT https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Replaced title",
  "body": "Replaced body",
  "userId": 1
}

### PATCH — partial update
PATCH https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Only the title changes"
}

### DELETE
DELETE https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
